# The repository root ignores `.wash/`, but this project's build configuration
# lives there, so a checkout without it does not build. Re-include the
# directory first — git cannot re-include a file whose parent is excluded — and
# then the one file that belongs in git. The endpoint, its `allowedHosts` and
# any CA path are added locally; see the README.
!.wash/
.wash/*
!.wash/config.yaml

target/

# Fetched by `wash wit fetch`; regenerated by `wash build`.
wit/deps/
wkg.lock
